# boltverse-odyssey — Grok Build / Cursor

Recipe repo. Not an app. Player is already https://boltverse-odyssey.grok.me

Happy path: clone → read AGENTS.md + GROK.md → `node scripts/cook-room.mjs <slot> --dry-run` → `export XAI_API_KEY=... && node scripts/cook-room.mjs <slot>`

If you cannot run node + (live) XAI_API_KEY: REFUSE cook. No chat Imagine fallback.

BANNED for hall stills / walks / breaths / enter:
imagine_image_to_video, imagine_reference_to_video, imagine_image_to_image
(no last_frame → do not Hang)

Hooks only: scripts/cook-room.mjs → scripts/imagine-hooks.mjs
Hung PASS = reuse. --force recooks. Gel-breath / FAIL walk = HANG BLOCKED, not KEEP.
Doors = RECT energy rifts (never oval). Sit / face / 3/4 / punch-sill (climbing the rift) / mid-hall spawn-cx as at-A/at-B cannot PASS.
No new grok.me. Catalog slots only.
